@startuml
!include _style.iuml
!pragma layout smetana
title State Diagram - Life Cycle of an IP Address (v2)

[*] --> Normal
Normal : no recent failures
Normal --> Watched : wrong password
Watched : failures counted per account+IP,\nper IP and per account (10 min)
Watched --> Watched : more failures\n(below every limit)
Watched --> Normal : failures older than 10 min\nor a successful login (Rule 1)
Watched --> PairLocked : Rule 1: 5 failures\nfor one account
PairLocked : only that account is refused\nfrom this IP for 15 min
PairLocked --> Watched : 15 minutes pass\nor admin lifts the lock
Watched --> Blocked : Rule 2 (4 accounts)\nor Rule 3 (10 failures)
Blocked : every login refused;\nlength 15 min -> 1 h -> 24 h (Rule 5)
Blocked --> Blocked : any request\n(saved as BLOCKED, expiry not extended)
Blocked --> Normal : block expires\nor admin unblocks
Normal --> Banned : admin bans permanently
Banned : refused until the admin unblocks
Banned --> Normal : admin unblocks
Normal --> Trusted : admin adds to allow-list
Trusted : never blocked by Rules 2, 3, 5\n(account locks still apply)
Trusted --> Normal : removed from allow-list
@enduml
